        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="unnamed (1)">
            <value>11/2025 UPDATE;  Might be changed to a 34 story building which would make it the tallest in Berkeley.  ORIGINAL:  The 268-foot tall structure will yield around 417,210 square feet, with 389,710 square feet for housing, 7,500 square feet for ground-level retail, and roughly 20,000 square feet for the 51-car basement garage with garage access along Allston Way. Unit sizes will vary with 21 studios, 71 one-bedrooms, 113 two-bedrooms, 29 three-bedrooms, 69 four-bedrooms, and 23 five-bedrooms. Additional parking will be included for 295 bicycles.</value>
          </Data>
