        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AL_Y2X5O79Dzz9c8cIPolqiCW3SoFyODG4e0k9YtzZt2WYgyoc7dq4gGxlVQG6w4GU2gp_c3AvQ32nwNw1sILIbvkfkY5Smfipy9MFuGRgn3-Abn8jwQtiApwoX1T00xEJStWJ2vJ5UlHYbWZe5b_cWqWEV4PMAsqw4OQ45tmRCfOK6l1zDpL7FNA8YX72pSzpPwwcxqc1eK4CibNQ?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>unnamed (1): 17 story, 227 units, former UA Theater.  The 183-foot tall structure will yield around 214,000 square feet, including 227 apartments, a small entry lobby cafe, and parking for 90 cars. An additional 1,330 square feet will be provided for a single-car parking spot for retail use. Unit types will vary, with 32 studios, 49 two-bedrooms, 80 three-bedrooms, and 66 four-bedrooms. Of the 227 units, the project will provide 23 units as affordable to very low-income households.<br>LINK 1: https://sfyimby.com/2022/08/high-rise-plans-for-2274-shattuck-avenue-in-downtown-berkeley.html<br>LINK 2: https://www.berkeleyside.org/2022/08/18/goodbye-ua-developer-planning-apartments-for-movie-theater-site<br>LINK 3: https://www.panoramic.com/project/cityspace-2274/<br>UNITS: https://therealdeal.com/sanfrancisco/2023/03/23/six-proposed-highrises-would-tower-over-downtown-berkeley/<br>STORIES: https://sfyimby.com/2023/06/new-renderings-for-2274-shattuck-avenue-in-downtown-berkeley.html<br>HEIGHT: https://sfyimby.com/2024/03/17-story-proposal-for-2274-shattuck-avenue-moves-forward-downtown-berkeley.html<br>SQUARE FT: https://sfyimby.com/2024/11/meeting-tomorrow-for-2274-shattuck-avenue-in-downtown-berkeley.html<br>RETAIL: https://sfyimby.com/2024/12/board-vote-tomorrow-for-17-story-proposal-at-united-artist-theater-downtown-berkeley.html<br>CARS: https://www.sierraclub.org/sfbay/northern-alameda-county/blog/2025/04/letter-support-proposed-development-2274-shattuck-former<br>BIKES: <br>name: <br>description: <br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AL_Y2X4ZJiuEv4Yt-JBSErNp5urdwLWkIwRbSa5ZTFJ9MQIkw