        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="unnamed (1)">
            <value>17 story, 227 units, former UA Theater.  The 183-foot tall structure will yield around 214,000 square feet, including 227 apartments, a small entry lobby cafe, and parking for 90 cars. An additional 1,330 square feet will be provided for a single-car parking spot for retail use. Unit types will vary, with 32 studios, 49 two-bedrooms, 80 three-bedrooms, and 66 four-bedrooms. Of the 227 units, the project will provide 23 units as affordable to very low-income households.</value>
          </Data>
