          <Data name="unnamed (1)">
            <value>7 story, 75 units.  Across from Equinox gym  building.  The 75-foot tall structure will yield around 66,300 square feet, including 3,250 square feet for retail and 2,350 square feet for the ground-level garage. Parking will be provided for three cars and 44 bicycles.</value>
