        <description><![CDATA[unnamed (1): https://ceqanet.opr.ca.gov/2020040078/13<br>LINK 1: The proposed project includes demolition of six recreational tennis courts and an approximately 130-space surface parking lot located below the courts. The Project consists of an eight-level parking garage, approximately 235,000 square feet within a 30,000 square-foot footprint and approximately 115 feet tall (to the top of the elevator tower). The structure would provide parking for approximately 660 vehicle spaces and a minimum of 33 bicycles.<br>LINK 2: <br>LINK 3: <br>UNITS: <br>STORIES: <br>HEIGHT: <br>SQUARE FT: <br>RETAIL: <br>CARS: <br>BIKES: <br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="unnamed (1)">
            <value>https://ceqanet.opr.ca.gov/2020040078/13</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="LINK 1">
            <value>The proposed project includes demolition of six recreational tennis courts and an approximately 130-space surface parking lot located below the courts. The Project consists of an eight-level parking garage, approximately 235,000 square feet within a 30,000 square-foot footprint and approximately 115 feet tall (to the top of the elevator tower). The structure would provide parking for approximately 660 vehicle spaces and a minimum of 33 bicycles.</value>
          </Data>
